      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan “amaun cukai” perkataan “atau apa-apa penalti”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__chp_VI__cl_56__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__chp_VI__cl_56",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan “dan cukai” perkataan “atau penalti”."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__chp_V__cl_44",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "44",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__chp_V",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Bab ini mula berkuat kuasa apabila berkuatkuasanya Akta ini. Pindaan seksyen 22"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__chp_V__cl_45",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "45",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__chp_V__cl_45__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__chp_V__cl_45__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__chp_V",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta Cukai Aktiviti Perniagaan Labuan 1990, yang disebut “Akta ibu” dalam Bab ini, dipinda dalam subseksyen 22(1)—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__chp_V__cl_45__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__chp_V__cl_45",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan perkataan “atau” yang terdapat selepas perkataan “perkiraan pencukaian dua kali” dengan koma; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__chp_V__cl_45__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__chp_V__cl_45",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan “perkiraan pertukaran maklumat pencukaian” perkataan “atau perkiraan bantuan pentadbiran bersama”. Pindaan seksyen 22a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__chp_V__cl_46",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
