      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam perenggan (1)(a)—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__chp_V__cl_46__para_a__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__chp_V__cl_46__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan perkataan “atau” yang terdapat selepas perkataan “perkiraan pencukaian dua kali” dengan koma; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__chp_V__cl_46__para_a__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__chp_V__cl_46__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan “perkiraan pertukaran maklumat percukaian” perkataan “atau perkiraan bantuan pentadbiran bersama”."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__chp_V__cl_46__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__chp_V__cl_46",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (2), dengan memasukkan sebelum takrif “perkiraan pencukaian dua kali” takrif yang berikut: ‘ “perkiraan bantuan pentadbiran bersama” ertinya suatu perkiraan antara Kerajaan Malaysia dengan Kerajaan mana-mana wilayah di luar Malaysia dengan tujuan bantuan pentadbiran bersama dalam perkara percukaian yang termasuk pemeriksaan cukai serentak, pertukaran maklumat secara automatik atau pentadbiran cukai luar negara di bawah seksyen 132B Akta Cukai Pendapatan 1967;’."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__cl_30",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "30",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__cl_30__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__cl_30__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__cl_30__subsec_3"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__cl_30__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__cl_30",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu hendaklah terpakai bagi maksud Bahagian ini melainkan jika diperuntukkan selainnya."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__cl_30__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__cl_30__subsec_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__cl_30__subsec_2__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__cl_30__subsec_2__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__cl_30",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Bagi maksud Bahagian ini, baki 108 merujuk kepada—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__cl_30__subsec_2__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__cl_30__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "amaun baki bagi kredit bagi suatu syarikat pada akhir tempoh asas bagi tahun taksiran 2007 yang ditentukan di bawah subseksyen 108(8) Akta ibu sebelum permulaan kuat kuasa Akta Kewangan 2007 [Akta 683];"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__cl_30__subsec_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__cl_30__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "amaun baki bagi kredit bagi syarikat itu yang ditentukan di bawah seksyen 23 Akta Cukai Pendapatan (Pindaan) 2000 [Akta A1093] setakat 31 Disember 2007; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__cl_30__subsec_2__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__cl_30__subsec_2__para_c__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__cl_30__subsec_2__para_c__subpara_ii"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__cl_30__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "jika tempoh asas bagi syarikat itu bagi tahun taksiran 2007 berakhir—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__cl_30__subsec_2__para_c__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__cl_30__subsec_2__para_c",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "pada hari selain 31 Disember 2007, mana-mana cukai yang dibayar dalam tempoh bermula dari hari pertama tempoh asas syarikat itu bagi tahun taksiran 2008 hingga 31 Disember 2007; atau"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__cl_30__subsec_2__para_c__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__cl_30__subsec_2__para_c",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "pada 31 Disember 2007, ansuran terakhir yang dibayar di bawah seksyen 107c Akta ibu berkenaan dengan tempoh asas itu."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__cl_30__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__cl_30",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Jika terdapat apa-apa ketidakselarasan antara mana-mana peruntukan Bahagian ini dengan mana-mana peruntukan Akta ibu, peruntukan Akta ibu itu adalah terbatal setakat ketidakselarasan itu. Baki 108"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__cl_31",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "31",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__cl_31__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__cl_31__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Jika dalam tempoh asas bagi tahun taksiran 2016 atau mana- mana tempoh asas yang berikutnya—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__cl_31__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__cl_31",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "cukai yang dikenakan ke atas pendapatan yang boleh dikenakan cukai bagi suatu syarikat bagi tahun taksiran 2000 berasaskan tahun semasa dan tahun taksiran yang sebelumnya dilepaskan atau diremitkan; atau"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__cl_31__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__cl_31",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "apa-apa amaun cukai yang dibayar oleh syarikat itu yang telah diambil kira bagi maksud pengiraan baki 108 itu dibayar balik, baki 108 syarikat itu, hendaklah pada hari cukai itu dilepaskan, diremitkan atau dibayar balik, dikurangkan mengikut apa-apa amaun cukai yang dilepaskan, diremitkan atau dibayar balik itu (selepas ini disebut “baki 108 tersemak”). Amaun lebihan baki 108"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__cl_32",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "32",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__cl_32__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__cl_32__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__cl_32__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__cl_32",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Jika amaun baki 108 tersemak melebihi baki 108, atau baki 108 tersemak setakat 31 Disember 2013, Ketua Pengarah hendaklah menyerahkan kepada syarikat suatu rekuisisi bertulis dalam borang yang ditetapkan yang menghendaki syarikat itu untuk membayar suatu amaun yang bersamaan dengan lebihan itu dan amaun itu hendaklah menjadi suatu hutang yang kena dibayar oleh syarikat itu kepada Kerajaan dan hutang itu hendaklah menjadi kena dibayar dengan serta-merta kepada Ketua Pengarah apabila rekuisisi itu diserahkan."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__cl_32__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_II__cl_32",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Jika apa-apa lebihan yang genap masa dan kena dibayar oleh suatu syarikat tidak dibayar dalam tempoh tiga puluh hari selepas serahan rekuisisi yang disebut di bawah subseksyen (3), sekian banyak amaun lebihan yang belum berbayar hendaklah tanpa notis lanjut diserahkan, dinaikkan dengan suatu amaun yang bersamaan dengan sepuluh peratus daripada lebihan yang tidak dibayar, dan amaun yang tidak dibayar itu dan kenaikan ke atas amaun yang tidak dibayar itu hendaklah menjadi suatu hutang yang kena dibayar kepada Kerajaan dan hutang itu hendaklah menjadi kena dibayar dengan serta merta kepada Ketua Pengarah.”."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_I__cl_10",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "10",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_I__cl_10__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_I__cl_10__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_I__cl_10__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_I",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subseksyen 39(1) Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_I__cl_10__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_I__cl_10",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memotong perkataan “or” di hujung perenggan (m);"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_I__cl_10__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_I__cl_10",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan noktah di hujung perenggan (n) dengan koma bernoktah; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_I__cl_10__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_I__cl_10",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas perenggan (n) perenggan yang berikut: “(o) any amount paid or to be paid in respect of goods and services tax as input tax by the person if he is liable to be registered under the Goods and Services Tax Act 2014 and has failed to do so, or if he is entitled under that Act to credit that amount as input tax; (p) any amount of output tax paid or to be paid under the Goods and Services Tax Act 2014 which is borne by the person if he is registered or liable to be registered under that Act; or (q) any remuneration or other income in respect of services performed or rendered in Malaysia by a public entertainer from which tax is deductible under section 109a, if tax has not been deducted therefrom and paid to the Director General in accordance with that section: Provided that— (i) this paragraph shall not apply if the payer has paid the amount of tax and the increased sum due from him to the Government in accordance with subsection 109(2); and (ii) where such amount of tax and the increased sum are paid after the due date for the furnishing of a return for a year of assessment that relates to such tax and the increased sum, the amount of tax and the increased sum so paid shall not prejudice the imposition of penalty under subsection 113(2) if a deduction on such payment is made in such return or is claimed in the information given to the Director General in arriving at the adjusted income of the payer.”. Pindaan seksyen 45a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_I__cl_11",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "11",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_I",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 45a Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan “three thousand ringgit” dengan perkataan “four thousand ringgit”. Pindaan seksyen 46"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_I__cl_12",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "12",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_I__cl_12__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/msa@/~part_I__cl_12__para_b",
