        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas perenggan 25c perenggan yang berikut: “25d. Sums received by way of gratuity on retirement from an employment under any written law or termination of a contract of employment other than when paragraph 25, 25a, 25B or 30a applies: Provided that the sums shall not exceed an amount ascertained by multiplying the sum of one thousand ringgit by the number of completed year of service of that individual.”;"
